 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's really common. A simple hello every few minutes is enough to give her something to point at. Then let her be the star. Ask the teacher to call her Lala, and use that name throughout the day. Most kids will be surprised. Use the name whenever you' talking about her, even on the playground. It' like a little secret language. Check if you can download quizzes and games as apps. Lots of free teaching apps work well with simple stories or math flashcards.",
